<title>USA: IPO HIGHLIGHTS-Resort operator Silverleaf up.</title>
<headline>IPO HIGHLIGHTS-Resort operator Silverleaf up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Silverleaf Resorts Inc's shares were up 2-3/8 to 18-3/8 on fairly heavy volume of around two million shares in early afternoon trading, after opening with a 2-1/2 point premium at 18-1/2.</p>
<p>Vincent Slavin, who ranks initial public offerings at Cantor Fitzgerald, had given the deal an &quot;A+&quot; rating.</p>
<p>Silverleaf is a developer, marketer and operator of timeshare resorts in the economy segment of the timeshare industry.  Its 3.5 million share deal was lead-managed by CS First Boston.</p>
</text>
